, Stacey and Yolanda, and more!c\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-05-01\",\"runtime\":20},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Epic Showdowns: Mommy Mayhem\",\"overview\":\"Dance Moms will do anything to protect their daughters. Join OG Dance Mom Christi Lukasiak as she relives the fiercest Dance Moms battles waged in their children's names.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-05-01\",\"runtime\":21},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Epic Showdowns: If Looks Could Kill\",\"overview\":\"In the world of competitive dance your wardrobe can make or break your performance. Join OG Dance Mom Christi Lukasiak as she relives the most intense wardrobe catastrophes.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-05-01\",\"runtime\":20},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Epic Showdowns: Pyramid Pandemonium\",\"overview\":\"At the Abby Lee Dance Company the infamous pyramid decides your fate on the team and every dance mom will fight for their child to be at the top.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-05-01\",\"runtime\":20},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Epic Showdowns: That's Messed Up!\",\"overview\":\"OG Dance Mom Christi Lukasiak hosts a rundown of some of the most cringeworthy clashes in Dance Moms history, including a rare showdown between Abby and Melissa, and Christi's own fights with Abby that forced her to leave the ALDC once and for all.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-05-08\",\"runtime\":20},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Epic Showdowns: Flyin' Solo\",\"overview\":\"Getting a solo at the ALDC is cutthroat because it's every dancer's chance to shine. But behind the scenes it's the moms who will throw down to get the spotlight for their kid. Join OG Dance Mom Christi Lukasiak as she relives some of the biggest solo showdowns like the time Melissa finally stood up for Mackenzie and her potato chip solo, when Abby gave last minute solos to JoJo and Nia after the rest of the team didn't show, or when Jessalyn snagged a solo for JoJo out from under Kendall.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-05-08\",\"runtime\":20},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Epic Showdowns: Reunion Madness\",\"overview\":\"Join OG Dance Mom Christi Lukasiak as she recounts the most unforgettable moments from Dance Moms reunion specials, including her own showdown with both Abby and Melissa, Holly and Jill settling an old score, and a walkout by Abby which threatens the fate of the show.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-05-08\",\"runtime\":20},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Epic Showdowns: Abby Flips Out\",\"overview\":\"Abby was the ultimate control freak, and when she felt it slipping away, nothing or no one was safe from being cut. OG Dance Mom Christi Lukasiak hosts a trip down memory lane, revisiting some of Abby's most volatile moments, like her blowup at Holly and a confrontation with rival Studio 19.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-05-08\",\"runtime\":21},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Epic Showdowns: Cathy Chaos\",\"overview\":\"No rivalry is quite like the one between the ALDC and the Candy Apples. Join OG Dance Mom Christi Lukasiak as she breaks down the epic rivalry between Abby and her arch nemesis Cathy. From the time Cathy tried to cheat her way through competition, to her surprise appearance at the ALDC annual recital, to their epic showdown at Nationals.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-05-15\",\"runtime\":20},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Epic Showdowns: Mother Knows Best\",\"overview\":\"Put a bunch of alpha dance moms under one roof...and the end result is chaos. Join OG Dance Mom Christi Lukasiak as she looks back on classic mom showdowns, including some of her own clashes with Leslie and Kristie Ray, and a knockdown drag out battle between the junior team moms.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-05-15\",\"runtime\":20},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Beyond the Reunion: Extended Family\",\"overview\":\"The cast of Dance Moms reunite and discuss how they see each other as family, and also reminisce about the colorful guest characters that the ALDC met along the way.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-05-01\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Beyond the Reunion: Rivalries\",\"overview\":\"It's the Dance Moms Reunion, and the girls have lots more to say! Brooke, Paige, Chloe, Kendall, Jojo and Kalani talk about the ALDC's biggest rivals and how they dealt with the constant pressure of competition.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-05-02\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"Beyond the Reunion: When Dances Go Wrong\",\"overview\":\"The cast of Dance Moms have their long awaited reunion, and the girls have lots more to say! Brooke, Paige, Chloe, Kendall, Jojo and Kalani reminisce about some of their biggest snafus on and off the stage.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-05-03\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"Beyond the Reunion: Best Dance Moments\",\"overview\":\"Relive the magic as the Dance Moms cast reunites to reveal behind-the-scenes secrets of their best dance moments. With candid reflections and unseen details, this episode celebrates the routines that left fans speechless and shaped the Dance Moms legacy.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-05-04\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"Beyond the Reunion: All About Abby\",\"overview\":\"It's the long awaited reunion of Dance Moms, and the reflect on Abby's best, worst and most iconic moments.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-05-05\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":17,\"name\":\"Beyond the Reunion: Joining Dance Moms\",\"overview\":\"Step into the Dance Moms world through the eyes of Jojo, Kendall, and Kalani as they share their powerful stories of joining the team.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-05-06\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":18,\"name\":\"Beyond the Reunion: OG Journeys\",\"overview\":\"Get up close and personal with Dance Moms OG's Paige, Brooke, and Chloe as they revisit their unforgettable journeys on the show. From fierce routines to emotional moments, see how Dance Moms shaped their lives and where their paths have taken them since.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-05-07\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":19,\"name\":\"Beyond the Reunion: Drama\",\"overview\":\"The cast of Dance Moms have lots more to say after their long awaited reunion! Brooke, Paige, Chloe, Kendall, Jojo and Kalani recount some of the most dramatic clashes between the moms and the dance teachers, many of them during Abby's infamous pyramids.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-05-08\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":20,\"name\":\"Beyond the Reunion: Extra Scenes\",\"overview\":\"The cast of Dance Moms reunite to relive their best and worst moments on the show, and where they are now. Here are extra scenes from the reunion that were left on the cutting room floor.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-05-09\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":21,\"name\":\"Beyond the Reunion: Me and My Dance Mom\",\"overview\":\"It's the Dance Moms Reunion, and the girls have lots more to say! Brooke, Paige, Chloe, Kendall, Jojo and Kalani team up with their moms to discuss their journeys as part of the ALDC.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-05-10\",\"runtime\":42}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2024-05-01\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}